  "sourceTitle": "Jeff-Qwen3.5-0.8B v1.2 + 9 LoRA adapters: put it in front of Qwen3.8-27B for 38× faster decisions and +8.7 points accuracy, for under 2 GB extra memory",
  "sourceBodyHash": "68775c6dfac4dd32767f02ff9df19e58f7752e541b0af8f14f41fd85218ea6b7",
